  "description": {
    "en": "Luxilon Eco Power is a high-performance polyester monofilament made from 100% recycled materials. Its durable heavy-duty construction combines power, spin and control while retaining enough forgiveness for touch and finesse shots. The hexagonal profile grips the ball at impact to increase spin and help players control aggressive trajectories. Designed for versatile all-court players, Eco Power combines modern polyester performance with a more sustainable material platform.",

    "zh": "Luxilon Eco Power 是一款采用 100% 再生材料制造的高性能聚酯单丝球线，将力量、旋转、控制和耐久性结合在一起，同时在处理小球和细腻击球时仍保留一定容错性。六边形截面能够在触球瞬间增强咬球能力，帮助球员产生更多旋转并提高攻击性击球的落点控制。它非常适合打法全面、挥拍速度较快，同时希望选择更可持续网球装备的中高级球员。"
  },

